  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Solana -- capable of 65,000+ transactions per second with sub-second finality and sub-cent fees. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, NFTs, and token data on Solana programs. Ideal for high-frequency OASIS data workloads. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture -- switch providers at runtime, zero code changes. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
